# Charged ollie and a frontside 180 (hold A about 0.3 s; regular, so turning left is frontside): lands rolling fakie, scores an FS 180.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold left 92..130
run 320
expect event land{fakie=true} within 160..240
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 180} within 160..240
expect no event bail
